  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Endless Japanese and American ephemera are juxtaposed, overlapped and manipulated to create complex crosscultural visions-the printing of this artist̀s book involved as a many as 150 runs on the press. Each copy is unique: the printing incorporated paper from a variety of sources including Atlanta billboards and throwaway sheets from previous printings in Japan." -- from the artist's website, accessed 3/29/2012.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Four-color printed with flourescent inks substituted for process color. Printed on numerous papers including transparent stock, previously printed billboard images, discarded paper 26 individually-glued facsimiles of vintage photographs. Case bound." -- from the artist's website, accessed 3/29/2012.</subfield>
  </datafield>
